  "details": "Before 2022, once a map was downloaded on PC, you could enter it immediately. However, at some point, it changed, and now you can’t enter the map as soon as it finishes downloading. Even with very lightweight worlds, the loading process is very slow, similar to migrating into VR. I’d like it to be changed back so that you can enter the map as soon as it finishes downloading, like before.",
